                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "26b836b8-5fe7-301d-af45-d78aa1795542",
                        "entry_id": "5f798002-1223-3910-8acd-8ed15d29a1da",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who willingly participates in immoral or destructive actions without ethical qualms because the actions are acceptable to society."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9c14be5-76fd-4c19-adb3-6d3cbf0bbac9",
                                "sense_id": "26b836b8-5fe7-301d-af45-d78aa1795542",
                                "text": "Hence, no special moral or political perversion is required to produce an Eichmann; it might be said that there are thousands of potential Eichmanns."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a13a9c33-b065-4ba5-80a7-c7713f7b2819",
                                "sense_id": "26b836b8-5fe7-301d-af45-d78aa1795542",
                                "text": "Their arguments usually involve holding variants of the claim that the life of an Eichmann or a Stalin could not have been an integrated one..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c03303a-b350-4307-8ab8-9ebc8646ddf5",
                                "sense_id": "26b836b8-5fe7-301d-af45-d78aa1795542",
                                "text": "One can imagine an Eichmann who was capable of questioning the meaning of this or that defense for his actions that he might give..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0cbf06a-6a86-4fc9-9907-4fd97901a9f8",
                                "sense_id": "26b836b8-5fe7-301d-af45-d78aa1795542",
                                "text": "Does the notion of a scientific gaze and the impersonality of method allow for an Eichmann in the scientist in all of us?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2166ed00-1f8c-4862-b487-8286aeb55edb",
                                "sense_id": "26b836b8-5fe7-301d-af45-d78aa1795542",
                                "text": "\"I've been accused of playing an Eichmann-like role in supporting an evil policy.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
